{"3567660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Funfair Billionaire", "steam_appid": 3567660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3567900], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dream of becoming a billionaire by draining rigged carnival machines? Welcome to <strong>FUNFAIR BILLIONAIRE</strong>, the game where you throw your fake money into shady attractions just for the thrill of watching numbers go up (or not).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game that reeks of sweat, blurry pixels, and questionable game design. Built with the blood, sweat, and tears of a developer who probably should have stayed an accountant but instead decided to create his &quot;masterpiece&quot;—badly optimized and with a certain disdain for usability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ A GAMEPLAY EXPERIENCE AS ADDICTIVE AS IT IS UNFAIR ✨</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 Throw your fake cash into machines as rigged as your last failed relationship:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎰 <strong>Slot Machine</strong> – Win big! (Well… if the algorithm decides to let you.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 <strong>Coin Pusher</strong> – Watch coins fall and experience a shameful level of excitement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦾 <strong>Claw Machine</strong> – A physics system straight out of a nightmare. Good luck grabbing that cursed gold bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔴 <strong>Roulette</strong> – Bet everything on red, instantly regret it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ♣  <strong>Blackjack</strong>– Bank always wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>KeyMaster </strong>– Look at it bounce like a half-cooked spaghetti</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦓 <strong>Zebra Race </strong>– Don't... Don't play this. It is the best way to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🇯🇵 <strong>Pachinko</strong> – We're still trying to figure out how it works.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ THE FORTUNE TELLER MACHINE: A MYSTERIOUS VOID ⭐</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too much money? Seek wisdom from <strong>The Fortune Teller Machine</strong>, a mystical entity that promises to reveal your destiny… but, let’s be honest, mostly mocks you. <strong>Mystical? Yes. Useful? Absolutely not.</strong> But who knows? Maybe it’s right (spoiler: it’s not).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵 A SOUND EXPERIENCE STRAIGHT FROM HELL 🎧</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound in this game was <strong>personally crafted by the developer</strong>. And guess what? He has <strong>zero musical talent</strong>. Expect off-key jingles, suspiciously sourced sound effects, and a soundtrack that will make you question your love for music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 FEATURES WE PROBABLY SHOULD HAVE TESTED 🔥</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌬 <strong>Graphics</strong> – An unintentional tribute to the PS2 era, but blurrier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔋 <strong>Optimization</strong> – Runs at <strong>22 FPS on a gaming PC</strong> yet somehow hits 60 FPS on a toaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😡 <strong>Guaranteed Rage</strong> – Every session is a life lesson in existential frustration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUNFAIR BILLIONAIRE</strong> is the game that will make you say:<br><i>&quot;Why am I still playing this?&quot;</i><br>and then <i>&quot;Alright, just one more round...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available on Steam. Buy it, or just throw your money out the window—the result will be the same. 🎡🎰💸</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dream of becoming a billionaire by draining rigged carnival machines? Welcome to <strong>FUNFAIR BILLIONAIRE</strong>, the game where you throw your fake money into shady attractions just for the thrill of watching numbers go up (or not).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game that reeks of sweat, blurry pixels, and questionable game design. Built with the blood, sweat, and tears of a developer who probably should have stayed an accountant but instead decided to create his &quot;masterpiece&quot;—badly optimized and with a certain disdain for usability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ A GAMEPLAY EXPERIENCE AS ADDICTIVE AS IT IS UNFAIR ✨</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 Throw your fake cash into machines as rigged as your last failed relationship:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎰 <strong>Slot Machine</strong> – Win big! (Well… if the algorithm decides to let you.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 <strong>Coin Pusher</strong> – Watch coins fall and experience a shameful level of excitement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦾 <strong>Claw Machine</strong> – A physics system straight out of a nightmare. Good luck grabbing that cursed gold bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔴 <strong>Roulette</strong> – Bet everything on red, instantly regret it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ♣  <strong>Blackjack</strong>– Bank always wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 <strong>KeyMaster </strong>– Look at it bounce like a half-cooked spaghetti</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦓 <strong>Zebra Race </strong>– Don't... Don't play this. It is the best way to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🇯🇵 <strong>Pachinko</strong> – We're still trying to figure out how it works.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ THE FORTUNE TELLER MACHINE: A MYSTERIOUS VOID ⭐</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too much money? Seek wisdom from <strong>The Fortune Teller Machine</strong>, a mystical entity that promises to reveal your destiny… but, let’s be honest, mostly mocks you. <strong>Mystical? Yes. Useful? Absolutely not.</strong> But who knows? Maybe it’s right (spoiler: it’s not).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵 A SOUND EXPERIENCE STRAIGHT FROM HELL 🎧</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound in this game was <strong>personally crafted by the developer</strong>. And guess what? He has <strong>zero musical talent</strong>. Expect off-key jingles, suspiciously sourced sound effects, and a soundtrack that will make you question your love for music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 FEATURES WE PROBABLY SHOULD HAVE TESTED 🔥</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌬 <strong>Graphics</strong> – An unintentional tribute to the PS2 era, but blurrier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔋 <strong>Optimization</strong> – Runs at <strong>22 FPS on a gaming PC</strong> yet somehow hits 60 FPS on a toaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😡 <strong>Guaranteed Rage</strong> – Every session is a life lesson in existential frustration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUNFAIR BILLIONAIRE</strong> is the game that will make you say:<br><i>&quot;Why am I still playing this?&quot;</i><br>and then <i>&quot;Alright, just one more round...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available on Steam. Buy it, or just throw your money out the window—the result will be the same. 🎡🎰💸</p>", "short_description": "Funfair Billionaire is the ultimate experience of a carnival as shady as a scratched-off lottery ticket. Rigged machines, sadistic physics, and a fate sealed by an algorithm that despises you—because deep down, you enjoy suffering. One more round? Of course.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567660/cd82b73eaf9ef11c9c9ee6a739e6a46fbc68d38c/header.jpg?t=1788010238", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567660/2b965d02e3dd3344f76b35b645cb9d87ff6b7a7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788010238", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567660/2b965d02e3dd3344f76b35b645cb9d87ff6b7a7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788010238", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum"